== Events ==
=== Kernel update ===
PC02 will trigger a fight against [[Kernel]] level 50.

Message/s after winning:

[[Rival Billie]] approaches.

* Great job, NAME. Looks like Omnichannel let their AI out just to spite us. 
* You know, you're making quite a habit of saving the region. You should take a break for a change. 
* I hear there's a new walking trail that has opened up behind the old Mansion outside Flower City. Might be worth checking out.
* Me? I'm going to be a little busy over the next while. Let's just say they've finally let me into an exclusive club. 
* Come on, you're not going to make me give up all my perks, are you?

